OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to locate van driver after
OL,4,Adeath of cyclist
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating the death of a
OL,7,Fcyclist found at the side of a road
OL,8,Fhave launched an appeal to trace the
OL,9,Fdriver of a van they want to question.
OL,11,FDevon and Cornwall Police said officers
OL,12,Fwere called at about 10:35 BST on 11
OL,13,FAugust after a report of a cyclist
OL,14,Fbeing found off his bike at the side of
OL,15,Fthe road into Broadwoodwidger, Devon.
OL,17,FA local man in his 50s was pronounced
OL,18,Fdeceased at the scene despite
OL,19,Fresuscitation efforts, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
