OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to locate van driver after
OL,4,Adeath of cyclist
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers said they were keen to
OL,7,Fidentify the driver of a white van,
OL,8,Fwhich they have released a picture of,
OL,9,Fas it was believed that they may have
OL,10,Fwitnessed the cyclist's movements prior
OL,11,Fto him coming off his bike.
